  "translation": "Go tsebje go kgoši gore Bayuda bao ba tlilwego go tšwa go wena go ya go re, ba fihlile Yerushalayime, ba aga motseng wo o gannago le wo mabja, gomme ba phethile masakana, gomme ba kgokagantše motheo.",
